{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"role":"collection","externalID":"WorldModule","title":"WorldModule","symbolKind":"module"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Entity","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Resource"],"anchor":"Essentials"},{"title":"Grouping Components","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Bundle","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/BundleBuilder","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TupleBundle","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EitherBundle"],"anchor":"Grouping-Components"},{"title":"Querying and Updating Entities","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityQueryView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryRow","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntitiesView"],"anchor":"Querying-and-Updating-Entities"},{"title":"Filtering Queries","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/FilterTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/With","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Without","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Added","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Changed","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Allows"],"anchor":"Filtering-Queries"},{"anchor":"Speeding-Up-Queries","title":"Speeding Up Queries","abstract":[{"text":"Groups are made with ","type":"text"},{"code":"group(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", cached queries with ","type":"text"},{"code":"cache(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and indexes by value with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"index(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"; ","type":"text"},{"code":"lookup(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" finds the entities holding a value, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"lookup(_:equals:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the entities whose property at a key path equals one.","type":"text"}],"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/GroupError"]},{"title":"Deferring Changes","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Commands"],"anchor":"Deferring-Changes"},{"title":"Working with Resources","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Resources"],"anchor":"Working-with-Resources"},{"title":"Detecting Changes and Removals","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChangeTick","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/RemovedComponent"],"anchor":"Detecting-Changes-and-Removals"},{"title":"Disabling Entities and Using Prefabs","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Disabled","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Prefab"],"anchor":"Disabling-Entities-and-Using-Prefabs"},{"title":"Building Hierarchies","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AncestorsView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/DescendantsView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CyclicHierarchy","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/HierarchyError"],"anchor":"Building-Hierarchies"},{"title":"Relating Entities","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CleanupAction"],"anchor":"Relating-Entities"},{"title":"Sending Events","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Event","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Events","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EventsView"],"anchor":"Sending-Events"},{"anchor":"Reacting-to-Changes-with-Hooks-and-Observers","title":"Reacting to Changes with Hooks and Observers","abstract":[{"text":"Hooks are registered with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onAdd"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onInsert"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onRemove"},{"text":" on ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"},{"text":", for a component type","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or a query. Observers are registered with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"observe"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityEvent","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Trigger"]},{"title":"Saving and Loading Worlds","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryError","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryLookupError","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/MapEntities"],"anchor":"Saving-and-Loading-Worlds"},{"title":"Running Changes Concurrently","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Access","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ConcurrentChange"],"anchor":"Running-Changes-Concurrently"},{"title":"Errors","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/StaleEntity","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/MissingComponent","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/MissingResource"],"anchor":"Errors"},{"anchor":"Extended-Modules","title":"Extended Modules","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Swift"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"WorldModule is built around a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"},{"type":"text","text":", a value that holds everything your game or simulation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"knows. The world organizes that state with a few simple ideas:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"entity"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" is one thing in the world, such as a ball, a player or a particle. It has no data","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of its own; you refer to it by its handle, an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Entity"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"component","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" is a plain value that an entity holds, such as a position or a health total.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Any type that conforms to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component"},{"text":" can be a component, and an entity holds at most one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"component of each type.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"resource","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" is a value the world holds once, outside any entity, such as a clock or a score."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Any type that conforms to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Resource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be a resource."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The examples throughout this module’s documentation use these components:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct Position: Component { var x: Double, y: Double }","struct Velocity: Component { var dx: Double, dy: Double }","struct Health: Component { var current: Int }","struct Frozen: Component {}","struct Name: Component, Hashable { var value: String }"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Spawn-Entities-and-Work-with-Their-Components","text":"Spawn Entities and Work with Their Components","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Spawn an entity with the components it starts with. The world returns the entity’s handle, which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you use to read and change its components:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","let hero = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Ada\"), Position(x: 0, y: 0), Health(current: 100))","","world[Health.self, of: hero].current -= 30","world.insert(Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0), into: hero)","world.remove(Position.self, from: hero)","","print(world[Health.self, of: hero].current)","\/\/ Prints \"70\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Query-and-Update-Many-Entities","text":"Query and Update Many Entities","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Most of the work in a game applies to every entity that holds some set of components: every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity with a position and a velocity moves, every entity with health can take damage. A query"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"visits those entities and reads their components, and an update changes one component of each in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"place:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0))","world.spawn(Position(x: 5, y: 5), Velocity(dx: 0, dy: -1), Frozen())","","world.update(Position.self, reading: Velocity.self, where: .without(Frozen.self)) { position, row in","    position.x += row.components.dx","    position.y += row.components.dy","}","","var coordinates: [(Double, Double)] = []","for (_, position) in world.query(Position.self) {","    coordinates.append((position.x, position.y))","}","print(coordinates)","\/\/ Prints \"[(1.0, 0.0), (5.0, 5.0)]\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Filters such as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".without(Frozen.self)"},{"text":" narrow which entities a query or update visits. To learn","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"more, see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Defer-Structural-Changes-with-Commands","text":"Defer Structural Changes with Commands","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"While a query or update is visiting entities, you can’t spawn or despawn entities or add and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"remove their components. Record those changes in "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Commands","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instead, and apply them when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"visit is over:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Health(current: 0))","world.spawn(Health(current: 40))","","var commands = Commands()","for (entity, health) in world.query(Health.self) where health.current <= 0 {","    commands.despawn(entity)","}","world.apply(commands)","","print(world.count)","\/\/ Prints \"1\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Keep-World-Wide-State-in-Resources","text":"Keep World-Wide State in Resources","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A resource holds state that belongs to the whole world rather than to any entity:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct Elapsed: Resource { var seconds: Double }","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(Elapsed(seconds: 0))","world.resources[Elapsed.self].seconds += 0.5","","print(world.resources[Elapsed.self].seconds)","\/\/ Prints \"0.5\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Copy-Worlds-Freely","text":"Copy Worlds Freely","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A world is a value: assigning it to another variable makes an independent copy. Copies share"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"storage until one of them changes, so copying is cheap, and keeping an earlier state for undo, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replay or a comparison takes one assignment."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Store the state of a game or simulation as entities and components, and read and change it with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"queries, updates, and commands.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Targets":{"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/targets","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Targets"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The component that holds a source entity’s targets of a relation, with the relation’s value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for each.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Targets"}],"title":"Targets"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/GroupError":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/grouperror","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An error that grouping component types throws."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GroupError","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"GroupError","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GroupError","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/GroupError"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Component":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that can be stored as a component of an entity."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Component"}],"title":"Component","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Component"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/component"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/EitherBundle":{"title":"EitherBundle","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EitherBundle","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A bundle that holds one of two bundles, from an "},{"code":"if","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"-"},{"code":"else","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"switch","ty